  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added net10.0 as a target framework and IComparable-based overloads for IsInRange, IsGreaterThan and IsLessThan alongside the existing int-based overloads. Fixed ValidationFailure.PropertyName falling back to null for non-simple-member property expressions and made FlowValidationService idempotent against repeated assembly registration. Removed dead internal should-error state that was never populated or read.",
